hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"186","Innī ṣā'im, innī ṣā'im. I am fasting. I am fasting. Reference: Al-Bukhari, cf. Al-Asqalani, Fathul-BAri 4/103, Muslim 2/806."
"187","Allāhumma bārik lanā fī thamarinā, wa bārik lanā fī madīnatina, wa bārik lanā fī ṣāʿinā, wa bārik lanā fī muddinā. O Allah, bless us in our fruits, bless us in our city, bless us in our saʿ (a measure), and bless us in our mudd (a measure)."
